Feature: Pipeline Creation\n  Scenario: Add Optional Tags and Profile Image\n    Given the user is logged in and authorized to create pipelines\n    And a profile image is available for upload\n    When the user navigates to the pipeline creation interface\n    And the user enters a valid name \"Pipeline with Tags\" and description \"Pipeline with optional fields.\"\n    And the user adds tags \"Automation\" and \"Test\"\n    And the user uploads a profile image\n    And the user clicks \"Save\"\n    Then the pipeline should be saved successfully with the name, description, tags, and profile image